==Trivia==
This card is one of several featured in the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion's "Safari Zone" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], all of which can be found in the [[Kanto Safari Zone]] in Generations {{gen|I}} and {{gen|III}}.

===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Chansey|152}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Chansey|46}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expansion.
*'''Gentle Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Psyduck|70}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

